    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just messiness. it feels permanent. like no matter what i do, i'm just dragging them down. i see the way my sister looks at me, or how my dad sighs when i walk into the room. it's like they're all looking at a mistake that should've been fixed a long time ago. i just want to fix it. i want to make things right for them.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
